<https://w3id.org/prov-ai/run/agno/ag-20261002T092848/entity/1ffabbbe-822b-4b0a-b55e-8c6ae9190340-model-2026-10-02T09%3A30%3A13.230967%2B00%3A00-input> a provai:Message ;
